\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces Number of occurences of each the most common protein chains in the family constructured by the HomolgyRing pipeline. Family consists of 129 homolog chains from 64 different unique structures from the PDB. Structures may contain more than one protein chain transcribed from the same gene. Number of structures in the family that posses the protein corresponding to the given gene are also indicated. This table serves to give an overview of wich interchain interactions are well captured within the constructed hRIN.}}{38}{table.caption.27}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{tab:eloc-chain-count}{{1}{38}{Number of occurences of each the most common protein chains in the family constructured by the HomolgyRing pipeline. Family consists of 129 homolog chains from 64 different unique structures from the PDB. Structures may contain more than one protein chain transcribed from the same gene. Number of structures in the family that posses the protein corresponding to the given gene are also indicated. This table serves to give an overview of wich interchain interactions are well captured within the constructed hRIN}{table.caption.27}{}}
